    "title": "Boulder Feet Forward: Meeting people where they are.",
    "description": "Boulder Feet Forward is a peer-led, daily street outreach team in Boulder, Colorado. We bring meals, supplies, peer support, and case management to neighbors living outside, and we keep showing up."
  },
