        }
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_jf4t4m0751",
          "type": "component/imported-home-5",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "text1": "Small steps add up.",
            "text2": "In a typical week, we meet about 120 different people.",
            "text3": "We have served 13,705 meals since 2024.",
            "text4": "Every day, our peers answer about 10 questions about where to find something, who to call, or what comes next.",
            "text5": "Each year, about 20 people we have worked with reach stable housing.",
            "text6": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "5",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " where we gave basic needs. We count the connection, but we do not claim the housing."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "text7": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "10",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " where we are part of a larger care team."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "text8": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "5",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " where we are the primary support."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "text9": "Of the people who reach housing with us as their primary support, 4 out of 5 found their own way there.",
            "text10": "Self-resolutions are individual paths home that the person chose and pursued.",
            "text11": "Numbers as of October 2026, from the Boulder Feet Forward information packet.",
            "label12": "See our impact",
            "link12": {
              "type": "page",
              "page": "pg_4wv4ptm674"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
